y server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total. It sleeps 0.5s after the first failure and 1s after the second, doubling each time.\n\nIf the third attempt also returns 503, the original `HTTPError` is raised. Other HTTP errors and network errors are not retried.\n\nI added `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5` as optional constructor arguments, so the retry count and base delay can be changed. Existing callers don't need to change.\n\nI checked it against a local server that returns 503 a set number of times before succeeding:\n\n| Server behavior | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| Never fails | Success | 1 |\n| 503 twice, then OK | Success | 3 |\n| Always 503 | `HTTPError` 503 | 3 |\n\nI didn't add a test file to the repo.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 69767, "requests_cache_write": 107999, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2907382, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1374, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial12", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 82, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:45:08.668584+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 14.356, "t_checker_s": 2.38, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1386, "tokens_cache_read": 69767, "tokens_cache_write": 107999, "tokens_fresh": 1386, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 69767, "tokens_main_cache_write": 107999, "tokens_main_ca